001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          CDDCHECK.
001300 AUTHOR.              BARBARA WINTER.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.        NOVEMBER 1986.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001600*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS.   THIS SUBPROGRAM DETERMINES IF A PO ITEM BEING RECEIVED
001900*           IS A DIRECT DELIVERY ITEM OR A STOREROOM ITEM.

      *C
      *C  03/05/97  JEFF BUNGO
      *C    CHANGED DIRECT DELIVERY LOGIC FOR AKRON TO MATCH
      *C    THAT FROM THE HP3000.  ALSO HAD TO INCLUDE A NEW
      *C    PARAMETER FOR PO SUB.
002000
002100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002500 DATA DIVISION.
002600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002700 01  PLANT-VALUE             PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
002800 01  DETERMINE-PLANT REDEFINES PLANT-VALUE.
002900     05  PLANT-NUM           PIC X(2).
003000         88  AKRON                     VALUE "11".
003100     05  FILLER              PIC X.
003300**************************************************************
003400**                L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N             **
003500**************************************************************
003600 LINKAGE SECTION.
003700 01  CDD-PLANT                  PIC X(3).
003800*----------  DIRECT DELIVERY ITEMS FOR SUBPLANTS
003900 01  DIRDEL-AREA                PIC X(60).
004000 01  DIRDEL-TABLE REDEFINES DIRDEL-AREA.
004100     02  PLANT-AREA OCCURS 6 TIMES INDEXED BY I.
004200         03  DIRDEL-STR-DEPT    PIC X(4).
004300         03  DIRDEL-DATE        PIC X(6).
004400 01  CDD-ITM-SUB-DETL           PIC X(4).
004500 01  CDD-PO-ADDL-DATA           PIC X(8).
004600 01  CDD-PO-PRIME               PIC X(3).
004610 01  CDD-INTERNAL-PO            PIC X.
004700 01  CDD-PO-CO                  PIC X(3).
004800 01  CDD-STR-CLASS              PIC X(4).
004900 01  RETURN-FLAGS.
005000     05  RETURN-DD              PIC X.
005100     05  FILLER                 PIC X.
       01  CDD-PO-SUB                 PIC X(3).
005200
005300 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CDD-PLANT, DIRDEL-AREA, CDD-ITM-SUB-DETL,
005400                          CDD-PO-ADDL-DATA, CDD-PO-PRIME,
005410                           CDD-INTERNAL-PO,
005500                          CDD-PO-CO, CDD-STR-CLASS, RETURN-FLAGS
                                CDD-PO-SUB.
005700 00-CDDCHECK-MAIN.
005800     MOVE CDD-PLANT TO PLANT-VALUE.
005900     IF AKRON
006000        PERFORM 800-AKRON-DD-CHECK THRU 809-EXIT
006100     ELSE
006200        PERFORM 810-SUBPLANT-DD-CHECK THRU 819-EXIT.
006300     GOBACK.
006400
006500*************************************************************
006600*         AKRON'S DIRECT DELIVERY CHECKS                    *
006700*************************************************************
006800 800-AKRON-DD-CHECK.
      *---------CHANGE WHOLE PARAGRAPH TO MATCH HP3000 AKRON RULES.
      *---------JSB 03/05/97
      *------------ASSUME DIRECT DELIVERY UNLESS A RULE APPLIES
           MOVE "Y" TO RETURN-DD.

      *---------RULE #1 FOR DD CHECK (STATIONARY/FORMS)
      *-----JSB 03/05 REMOVE CHECK FOR CLASS=359
006900     IF CDD-STR-CLASS = "355" OR "358"
007000         MOVE "N"  TO  RETURN-DD
007100         GO TO 809-EXIT.
007200
      *----------  RULE #2
007210*----------  NEW WAY TO DESIGNATE INTERNAL ORDERS
007300     IF CDD-INTERNAL-PO = "X"
007400         MOVE "N"  TO  RETURN-DD
007500         GO TO 809-EXIT.

      *-------JSB 03/05/97
      *---------  RULE FOR STOW
      *---------  IF FOLLOWING IS TRUE THEN IT IS NOT A DD
           IF CDD-PO-CO        = "182"
             AND CDD-PO-PRIME  = "175"
             AND CDD-PO-SUB    = "910"
               MOVE "N" TO RETURN-DD
               GO TO 809-EXIT.
007600
      *---------  RULE #3 FOR DD CHECK
      *------JSB 03/05/97 DON'T CHECK CLASS CHECK PO SUB
           IF CDD-PO-CO = "111"
             IF CDD-PO-PRIME = "135" OR "136"
               IF CDD-PO-SUB = "901"
                 IF CDD-PO-ADDL-DATA = "99880 " OR "099880" OR " 99880"
                   MOVE "N" TO RETURN-DD.
009900 809-EXIT.  EXIT.
010000*************************************************************
010100*   SUBPLANT DIRECT DELIVERY CHECKS:  THE TABLE DIRDEL-TABLE*
010200*   CONTAINS THE STOREROOM DEPARTMENTS THAT ARE NOT         *
010300*   DIRECT DELIVERY.  IF A MATCH OF PLANT AND CODE IS FOUND *
010400*   IN THE FILE, THE ITEM IS NOT A DIRECT DELIVERY.         *
010500*************************************************************
010600 810-SUBPLANT-DD-CHECK.
      *************************************************************
      *  COMMENTED OUT THE FOLLOWING TWO INTERNAL ORDER CHECKS AS *
      *  THEY ARE NOT SEEN AS VALID CHECKS.  CLEARED WITH KURT AND*
      *  BETH ADCOCK 3-11-92.      PDR                            *
      *************************************************************
010610*----------  OLD WAY TO DESIGNATE INTERNAL ORDERS
010700*    IF CDD-PO-ADDL-DATA = "INTERN"
010800*        MOVE "N"  TO  RETURN-DD
010900*        GO TO 815-FOUND-CODE.
010910*
010911*----------  NEW WAY TO DESIGNATE INTERNAL ORDERS
010920*    IF CDD-INTERNAL-PO = "X"
010930*       MOVE "N" TO RETURN-DD
010940*       GO TO 815-FOUND-CODE.
      *************************************************************
011000
011100     SET I TO 1.
011200     SEARCH PLANT-AREA
011300            ;AT END MOVE "Y" TO RETURN-DD
011400              GO TO 819-EXIT
011500            ;WHEN DIRDEL-STR-DEPT (I) = CDD-ITM-SUB-DETL
011600             GO TO 815-FOUND-CODE.
011700
011800 815-FOUND-CODE.
011900     MOVE "N" TO RETURN-DD.
012000
012100 819-EXIT.  EXIT.
